Subject: [202605] Port model-specific AS5835 and AS7726 SDK settings

Extend the AS7326 SDK/VXLAN fixes to AS5835 (Maverick2) and AS7726
(Trident3), using each model's Edgecore BCM profile at d39662e9.
AS5835 retains its 8192 overlay egress allocation; AS7726 uses 32768.
Use the tested AS7326 128 MiB stable-cache allocation for these newer SDK
builds too, rather than the vendor's old 88 MiB workaround. These two
models have not been hardware-tested at 128 MiB. AS7816 is Tomahawk2,
and its vendor profile has none of these RIOT/stable-cache overrides;
leave its SDK profile unchanged. Preserve ports, aliases and MMU settings.
References: https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-buildimage/pull/22641
https://github.com/edge-core/sonic-buildimage/tree/d39662e996c0e8748c9b96ad88dc5f5f524e8048/device/accton

Verified source: 5ef9e45ccf7f004fb07bf3f9be2f471cf00573bf.
Remove individual fixes when upstream supplies equivalent behavior.
Software regressions cover these changes; only AS7326 has been
inspected live. Other models require installation/hardware validation.

--- a/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as5835_54x-r0/Accton-AS5835-54X/mv2-as5835-48x10G+6x100G.config.bcm
+++ b/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as5835_54x-r0/Accton-AS5835-54X/mv2-as5835-48x10G+6x100G.config.bcm
@@ -35,7 +35,7 @@
 module_64ports=1
 port_flex_enable=1
 schan_intr_enable=0
-stable_size=0x5500000 ;Specify the stable cache size in bytes used for Warm boot operations
+stable_size=0x8000000 ;Specify the stable cache size in bytes used for Warm boot operations
 tdma_timeout_usec=3000000
 skip_L2_USER_ENTRY=0
 bcm_tunnel_term_compatible_mode=1
@@ -485,3 +485,13 @@
 #phy_chain_rx_polarity_flip_physical{81.0}=0x1
 #phy_chain_tx_polarity_flip_physical{81.0}=0x1
 
+# VXLAN settings from Edgecore's Accton-AS5835-54X configuration.
+l3_ecmp_levels=2
+use_all_splithorizon_groups=1
+riot_enable=1
+sai_tunnel_support=1
+riot_overlay_l3_intf_mem_size=4096
+riot_overlay_l3_egress_mem_size=8192
+riot_overlay_ecmp_resilient_hash_size=16384
+flow_init_mode=1
+host_as_route_disable=1
--- a/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as7726_32x-r0/Accton-AS7726-32X/td3-as7726-32x100G.config.bcm
+++ b/device/accton/x86_64-accton_as7726_32x-r0/Accton-AS7726-32X/td3-as7726-32x100G.config.bcm
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-sai_load_hw_config=/etc/bcm/flex/bcm56870_a0_premium_issu/b870.6.4.1/
+sai_load_hw_config=/etc/bcm/flex/bcm56870_a0_premium_issu/default/
 #polarity/lanemap is using TH2 style.
 core_clock_frequency=1525
 dpp_clock_ratio=2:3
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 module_64ports=1
 port_flex_enable=1
 schan_intr_enable=0
-stable_size=0x5500000
+stable_size=0x8000000
 tdma_timeout_usec=3000000
 skip_L2_USER_ENTRY=0
 bcm_tunnel_term_compatible_mode=1
@@ -492,3 +492,14 @@
 phy_chain_tx_polarity_flip_physical{126.0}=0x1
 phy_chain_tx_polarity_flip_physical{127.0}=0x0
 phy_chain_tx_polarity_flip_physical{128.0}=0x0
+
+# VXLAN settings from Edgecore's Accton-AS7726-32X configuration.
+l3_ecmp_levels=2
+use_all_splithorizon_groups=1
+riot_enable=1
+sai_tunnel_support=1
+riot_overlay_l3_intf_mem_size=4096
+riot_overlay_l3_egress_mem_size=32768
+riot_overlay_ecmp_resilient_hash_size=16384
+flow_init_mode=1
+host_as_route_disable=1
